-to-b from-secondary/10 via-background to-background\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-1/4 -z-10 h-96 w-96 rounded-full bg-secondary/15 blur-3xl pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-10 -z-10 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-primary/5 blur-3xl pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-5xl text-center\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold tracking-wide text-primary mb-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px)\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11.017 2.814a1 1 0 0 1 1.966 0l1.051 5.558a2 2 0 0 0 1.594 1.594l5.558 1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0 1.966l-5.558 1.051a2 2 0 0 0-1.594 1.594l-1.051 5.558a1 1 0 0 1-1.966 0l-1.051-5.558a2 2 0 0 0-1.594-1.594l-5.558-1.051a1 1 0 0 1 0-1.966l5.558-1.051a2 2 0 0 0 1.594-1.594z\"></path><path d=\"M20 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 4h-4\"></path><circle cx=\"4\" cy=\"20\" r=\"2\"></circle></svg><span>OUR WORK &amp; LOCAL PARTNERSHIPS</span></div><h1 class=\"font-heading text-4xl sm:text-5xl md:text-6xl font-medium tracking-tight text-foreground mb-6\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px)\">Real Local Work.<!-- --> <span class=\"italic text-primary\">Real Community Impact.</span></h1><p class=\"mx-auto max-w-3xl text-lg sm:text-xl text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-10\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px)\">Take a look at the websites, mobile menus, and digital tools we&#x27;ve built right here in the Georgetown Divide and Foothills. From local contractors and business alliances to smokehouse menus and community charities - fast, honest, and built to turn interest into action.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-4 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 shadow-sm max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-10\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(15px)\"><div class=\"text-center p-2\"><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-primary\">100%</div><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground font-medium mt-0.5\">Foothill Tested</div></div><div class=\"text-center p-2 border-l border-border/40\"><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-primary\">&lt; 0.8s</div><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground font-medium mt-0.5\">Rural Speed Ready</div></div><div class=\"text-center p-2 border-l md:border-l border-border/40\"><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-primary\">Zero</div><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground font-medium mt-0.5\">Hostage Contracts</div></div><div class=\"text-center p-2 border-l border-border/40\"><div class=\"font-heading text-2xl font-bold text-primary\">1-Tap</div><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground font-medium mt-0.5\">Direct Calling</div></div></div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-2\"><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-all bg-primary text-primary-foreground shadow-sm scale-105\">All Projects (5)</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-all bg-secondary/30 text-foreground/80 hover:bg-secondary/50\">Live Websites (3)</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-all bg-secondary/30 text-foreground/80 hover:bg-secondary/50\">In The Workshop (2)</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-all bg-secondary/30 text-foreground/80 hover:bg-secondary/50\">Contractors &amp; Trades</button><button class=\"px-4 py-2 rounded-full text-xs sm:text-sm font-medium transition-all bg-secondary/30 text-foreground/80 hover:bg-secondary/50\">Community &amp; Eateries</button></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 md:py-24 container mx-auto px-4 max-w-6xl\"><div class=\"space-y-16\"><div class=\"group rounded-3xl border border-border/70 bg-card overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-0\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 bg-gradient-to-br from-muted/60 via-background to-muted/40 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-border/60\"><div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-background shadow-md overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"bg-muted/80 px-3 py-2 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border/60 text-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-400 inline-block\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 inline-block\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 inline-block\"></span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-background/80 border border-border/40 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground font-mono truncate max-w-[200px]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe h-3 w-3 text-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg><span class=\"truncate\">www.fixitcool.com</span></div><a href=\"https://www.fixitcool.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors\" title=\"Open site in new tab\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-emerald-950 via-slate-900 to-emerald-900 text-white relative min-h-[220px] flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden group-hover:scale-[1.01] transition-transform\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-15 pointer-events-none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-hammer h-32 w-32\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m15 12-9.373 9.373a1 1 0 0 1-3.001-3L12 9\"></path><path d=\"m18 15 4-4\"></path><path d=\"m21.5 11.5-1.914-1.914A2 2 0 0 1 19 8.172v-.344a2 2 0 0 0-.586-1.414l-1.657-1.657A6 6 0 0 0 12.516 3H9l1.243 1.243A6 6 0 0 1 12 8.485V10l2 2h1.172a2 2 0 0 1 1.414.586L18.5 14.5\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md text-[11px] font-semibold text-white mb-3\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse\"></span>Live in Production</div><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white font-heading\">Fix It Cool</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/80 line-clamp-2 mt-1\">Turning urgent home repair searches into immediate phone calls.</p></div><div class=\"relative z-10 pt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 border-t border-white/15\"><div class=\"bg-black/30 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white/90\"><span class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] block\">Mobile Speed</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">&lt; 0.8s</span></div><div class=\"bg-black/30 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white/90\"><span class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] block\">Conversion Focus</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Direct Call</span></div><div class=\"bg-black/30 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white/90\"><span class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] block\">Target Area</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Georgetown Divide</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"pt-6\"><a href=\"https://www.fixitcool.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-primary text-primary-foreground py-3 px-4 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-primary/90 transition-all shadow-sm group/btn\"><span>Visit <!-- -->Fix It Cool</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover/btn:translate-x-0.5 group-hover/btn:-translate-y-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-7 p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-secondary/30 text-xs font-semibold text-primary\">Contractors &amp; Home Repairs</span><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground font-mono\">www.fixitcool.com</span></div><h2 class=\"font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-3\">Fix It Cool<!-- -->:<!-- --> <span class=\"text-primary italic font-normal text-xl sm:text-2xl block sm:inline\">Turning urgent home repair searches into immediate phone calls.</span></h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6\">Designed for immediate mobile action. Built to load in under a second on spotty Sierra cell reception, featuring prominent one-tap calling, clear repair service categories, and verified local Foothills service radiuses.</p><div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-secondary/15 border border-secondary/30 mb-6\"><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary mb-1\">The Local Challenge We Solved</div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed\">Homeowners in Cool and the Divide needed a fast way to find reliable local help without wading through corporate directories or non-responsive forms.</p></div><div><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground mb-3\">Built-In Growth Features</div><ul class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>One-tap emergency call &amp; text buttons in header</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Sub-second load times on rural 3G/LTE connections</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Focused service areas covering Cool, ALT &amp; the Divide</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Clear upfront repair lists (carpentry, decks, plumbing, maintenance)</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"pt-8 mt-6 border-t border-border/60 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Looking for a similar setup for your business?</div><button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"button\" class=\"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border bg-clip-padding whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-background aria-expanded:bg-muted aria-expanded:text-foreground dark:border-input dark:bg-input/30 dark:hover:bg-input/50 h-7 px-2.5 text-[0.8rem] in-data-[slot=button-group]:rounded-lg has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-1.5 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-3.5 rounded-xl border-primary/30 hover:bg-primary hover:text-primary-foreground gap-2 font-medium\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap h-3.5 w-3.5 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg><span>I Want a Solution Like This</span></button></div></div></div></div><div class=\"group rounded-3xl border border-border/70 bg-card overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-0\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 bg-gradient-to-br from-muted/60 via-background to-muted/40 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-border/60\"><div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-background shadow-md overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"bg-muted/80 px-3 py-2 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border/60 text-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-400 inline-block\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 inline-block\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 inline-block\"></span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-background/80 border border-border/40 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground font-mono truncate max-w-[200px]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe h-3 w-3 text-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg><span class=\"truncate\">www.altbusinessconnections.org</span></div><a href=\"https://www.altbusinessconnections.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors\" title=\"Open site in new tab\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-amber-950 via-stone-900 to-amber-900 text-white relative min-h-[220px] flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden group-hover:scale-[1.01] transition-transform\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-15 pointer-events-none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users h-32 w-32\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.128a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.744\"></path><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md text-[11px] font-semibold text-white mb-3\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse\"></span>Live in Production</div><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white font-heading\">ALT Business Connections</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/80 line-clamp-2 mt-1\">Keeping local commerce and connection circulating right here on the Divide.</p></div><div class=\"relative z-10 pt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 border-t border-white/15\"><div class=\"bg-black/30 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white/90\"><span class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] block\">Community Reach</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Georgetown Divide</span></div><div class=\"bg-black/30 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white/90\"><span class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] block\">Member Hub</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Directory &amp; Events</span></div><div class=\"bg-black/30 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white/90\"><span class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] block\">Design Style</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Warm Foothill</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"pt-6\"><a href=\"https://www.altbusinessconnections.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-primary text-primary-foreground py-3 px-4 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-primary/90 transition-all shadow-sm group/btn\"><span>Visit <!-- -->ALT Business Connections</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover/btn:translate-x-0.5 group-hover/btn:-translate-y-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-7 p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-secondary/30 text-xs font-semibold text-primary\">Business Alliance &amp; Networking</span><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground font-mono\">www.altbusinessconnections.org</span></div><h2 class=\"font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-3\">ALT Business Connections<!-- -->:<!-- --> <span class=\"text-primary italic font-normal text-xl sm:text-2xl block sm:inline\">Keeping local commerce and connection circulating right here on the Divide.</span></h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6\">A welcoming, modern community hub that spotlights homegrown Divide businesses. Features an accessible directory, upcoming breakfast and mixer schedules, and straightforward membership paths to strengthen regional commerce.</p><div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-secondary/15 border border-secondary/30 mb-6\"><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary mb-1\">The Local Challenge We Solved</div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed\">Local entrepreneurs needed a centralized digital home to showcase verified local merchants and drive attendance to monthly networking breakfasts.</p></div><div><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground mb-3\">Built-In Growth Features</div><ul class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Searchable local merchant &amp; trade professional directory</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Monthly breakfast meeting announcements &amp; RSVPs</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Community-first branding celebrating Divide business owners</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Frictionless updates without complex maintenance overhead</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"pt-8 mt-6 border-t border-border/60 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Looking for a similar setup for your business?</div><button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"button\" class=\"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border bg-clip-padding whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invali