enter gap-1.5 px-3 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-background/80 border border-border/40 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground font-mono truncate max-w-[200px]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe h-3 w-3 text-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg><span class=\"truncate\">www.dividewomensclub.org</span></div><a href=\"https://www.dividewomensclub.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors\" title=\"Open site in new tab\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-stone-950 via-zinc-900 to-emerald-950 text-white relative min-h-[220px] flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden group-hover:scale-[1.01] transition-transform\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-15 pointer-events-none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart h-32 w-32\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md text-[11px] font-semibold text-white mb-3\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-pulse\"></span>Live in Production</div><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white font-heading\">Divide Women&#x27;s Club</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/80 line-clamp-2 mt-1\">Decades of community giving, youth scholarships, and volunteer events made modern.</p></div><div class=\"relative z-10 pt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 border-t border-white/15\"><div class=\"bg-black/30 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white/90\"><span class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] block\">Impact</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Annual Scholarships</span></div><div class=\"bg-black/30 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white/90\"><span class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] block\">Community</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Divide Towns</span></div><div class=\"bg-black/30 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white/90\"><span class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] block\">Format</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Accessible &amp; Clean</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"pt-6\"><a href=\"https://www.dividewomensclub.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-primary text-primary-foreground py-3 px-4 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-primary/90 transition-all shadow-sm group/btn\"><span>Visit <!-- -->Divide Women&#x27;s Club</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover/btn:translate-x-0.5 group-hover/btn:-translate-y-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-7 p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-secondary/30 text-xs font-semibold text-primary\">Community &amp; Historic Nonprofit</span><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground font-mono\">www.dividewomensclub.org</span></div><h2 class=\"font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-3\">Divide Women&#x27;s Club<!-- -->:<!-- --> <span class=\"text-primary italic font-normal text-xl sm:text-2xl block sm:inline\">Decades of community giving, youth scholarships, and volunteer events made modern.</span></h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6\">Serving our mountain towns for generations, the Divide Women&#x27;s Club now has an elegant, high-accessibility web presence. Local students and parents can easily apply for scholarships, and neighbors can stay informed on seasonal fundraisers.</p><div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-secondary/15 border border-secondary/30 mb-6\"><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary mb-1\">The Local Challenge We Solved</div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed\">A historic community anchor needed to modernize their outreach, simplify student scholarship applications, and boost turnout for community charity events.</p></div><div><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground mb-3\">Built-In Growth Features</div><ul class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Digital scholarship application downloads &amp; deadline alerts</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Seasonal event calendars (craft faires, bake sales, teas)</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>High-contrast, large-print mobile friendly typography</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Tribute to decades of Foothill community heritage and service</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"pt-8 mt-6 border-t border-border/60 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center justify-between gap