 lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-border/60\"><div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-background shadow-md overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"bg-muted/80 px-3 py-2 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border/60 text-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-400 inline-block\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 inline-block\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 inline-block\"></span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-background/80 border border-border/40 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground font-mono truncate max-w-[200px]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe h-3 w-3 text-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg><span class=\"truncate\">pig-sure-perfect-bbq.workers.dev</span></div><a href=\"https://pig-sure-perfect-bbq.growlocalcreative.workers.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors\" title=\"Open site in new tab\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-950 via-stone-900 to-amber-950 text-white relative min-h-[220px] flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden group-hover:scale-[1.01] transition-transform\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-15 pointer-events-none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-utensils h-32 w-32\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 2v7c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h4a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V2\"></path><path d=\"M7 2v20\"></path><path d=\"M21 15V2a5 5 0 0 0-5 5v6c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h3Zm0 0v7\"></path></svg></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md text-[11px] font-semibold text-white mb-3\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400 animate-pulse\"></span>In The Workshop</div><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white font-heading\">Pig-Sure Perfect BBQ</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/80 line-clamp-2 mt-1\">Mouth-watering mobile menu &amp; catering booking engine designed to pack the pit.</p></div><div class=\"relative z-10 pt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 border-t border-white/15\"><div class=\"bg-black/30 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white/90\"><span class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] block\">Menu Load</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">&lt; 300ms</span></div><div class=\"bg-black/30 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white/90\"><span class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] block\">Hosting</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Cloudflare Edge</span></div><div class=\"bg-black/30 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white/90\"><span class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] block\">Conversion</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Catering Bookings</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"pt-6\"><a href=\"https://pig-sure-perfect-bbq.growlocalcreative.workers.dev/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-primary text-primary-foreground py-3 px-4 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-primary/90 transition-all shadow-sm group/btn\"><span>Visit <!-- -->Pig-Sure Perfect BBQ</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover/btn:translate-x-0.5 group-hover/btn:-translate-y-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-7 p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-secondary/30 text-xs font-semibold text-primary\">Artisanal Eatery &amp; Catering</span><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground font-mono\">pig-sure-perfect-bbq.workers.dev</span></div><h2 class=\"font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-3\">Pig-Sure Perfect BBQ<!-- -->:<!-- --> <span class=\"text-primary italic font-normal text-xl sm:text-2xl block sm:inline\">Mouth-watering mobile menu &amp; catering booking engine designed to pack the pit.</span></h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6\">Nothing loses a customer faster than an unreadable PDF menu on a phone. For Pig-Sure Perfect BBQ, we designed an ultra-fast digital menu, real-time pop-up schedule, and instant catering quote pipeline that lets locals book authentic slow-smoked meats in seconds.</p><div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-secondary/15 border border-secondary/30 mb-6\"><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary mb-1\">The Local Challenge We Solved</div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed\">Hungry customers abandoning slow, pinch-and-zoom PDF menus while trying to find weekend smokehouse pop-up locations.</p></div><div><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground mb-3\">Built-In Growth Features</div><ul class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Zero-PDF mobile menu with vivid meats &amp; sides breakdowns</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Automated event catering quote request form with guest-count slider</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Pop-up location tracker for weekend smoke sessions</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Edge-deployed on Cloudflare Workers for instant 50ms load times</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"pt-8 mt-6 border-t border-border/60 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Looking for a similar setup for your business?</div><button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"button\" class=\"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border bg-clip-padding whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-background aria-expanded:bg-muted aria-expanded:text-foreground dark:border-input dark:bg-input/30 dark:hover:bg-input/50 h-7 px-2.5 text-[0.8rem] in-data-[slot=button-group]:rounded-lg has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-1.5 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-3.5 rounded-xl border-primary/30 hover:bg-primary hover:text-primary-foreground gap-2 font-medium\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap h-3.5 w-3.5 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg><span>I Want a Solution Like This</span></button></div></div></div></div><div class=\"group rounded-3xl border border-border/70 bg-card overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-0\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-5 bg-gradient-to-br from-muted/60 via-background to-muted/40 p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col justify-between border-b lg:border-b-0 lg:border-r border-border/60\"><div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-background shadow-md overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"bg-muted/80 px-3 py-2 flex items-center justify-between border-b border-border/60 text-xs\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-red-400 inline-block\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-400 inline-block\"></span><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 inline-block\"></span></div><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-0.5 rounded-md bg-background/80 border border-border/40 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground font-mono truncate max-w-[200px]\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe h-3 w-3 text-primary shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg><span class=\"truncate\">www.coolcharity.org</span></div><a href=\"https://www.coolcharity.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"text-muted-foreground hover:text-primary transition-colors\" title=\"Open site in new tab\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div><div class=\"p-6 bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-950 via-slate-900 to-teal-950 text-white relative min-h-[220px] flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden group-hover:scale-[1.01] transition-transform\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 p-4 opacity-15 pointer-events-none\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-compass h-32 w-32\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m16.24 7.76-1.804 5.411a2 2 0 0 1-1.265 1.265L7.76 16.24l1.804-5.411a2 2 0 0 1 1.265-1.265z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-white/20 backdrop-blur-md text-[11px] font-semibold text-white mb-3\"><span class=\"h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-amber-400 animate-pulse\"></span>In The Workshop</div><h3 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-white font-heading\">Cool Charity</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-white/80 line-clamp-2 mt-1\">Direct, transparent grassroots aid when our foothill neighbors need it most.</p></div><div class=\"relative z-10 pt-4 flex flex-wrap gap-1.5 border-t border-white/15\"><div class=\"bg-black/30 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white/90\"><span class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] block\">Transparency</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">100% Local</span></div><div class=\"bg-black/30 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white/90\"><span class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] block\">Focus</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Community Aid</span></div><div class=\"bg-black/30 backdrop-blur-md rounded-lg px-2.5 py-1 text-[11px] text-white/90\"><span class=\"text-white/60 text-[10px] block\">Structure</span><span class=\"font-semibold\">Grassroots</span></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"pt-6\"><a href=\"https://www.coolcharity.org\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"w-full inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-xl bg-primary text-primary-foreground py-3 px-4 text-sm font-semibold hover:bg-primary/90 transition-all shadow-sm group/btn\"><span>Visit <!-- -->Cool Charity</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-external-link h-4 w-4 transition-transform group-hover/btn:translate-x-0.5 group-hover/btn:-translate-y-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6\"></path><path d=\"M10 14 21 3\"></path><path d=\"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6\"></path></svg></a></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-7 p-6 sm:p-8 md:p-10 flex flex-col justify-between\"><div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-secondary/30 text-xs font-semibold text-primary\">Grassroots Relief &amp; Giving</span><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground font-mono\">www.coolcharity.org</span></div><h2 class=\"font-heading text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground mb-3\">Cool Charity<!-- -->:<!-- --> <span class=\"text-primary italic font-normal text-xl sm:text-2xl block sm:inline\">Direct, transparent grassroots aid when our foothill neighbors need it most.</span></h2><p class=\"text-sm sm:text-base text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-6\">Hyper-local mutual aid runs on radical transparency. Cool Charity is being built to connect Foothill neighbors directly to relief drives, emergency storm aid, and volunteer support with zero overhead and zero corporate middleman.</p><div class=\"p-4 rounded-2xl bg-secondary/15 border border-secondary/30 mb-6\"><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary mb-1\">The Local Challenge We Solved</div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/80 leading-relaxed\">Traditional charity portals feel impersonal and take heavy administrative cuts. Cool Charity needed a direct, local platform focused on trust and direct neighbor aid.</p></div><div><div class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground mb-3\">Built-In Growth Features</div><ul class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-2.5\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Transparent project-by-project community donation trackers</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Volunteer shift &amp; skill coordination board</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>Winter weather &amp; rural emergency relief resource hub</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-xs sm:text-sm text-foreground/90\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-4 w-4 text-primary shrink-0 mt-0.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span>100% focused on Cool and surrounding foothill communities</span></li></ul></div></div><div class=\"pt-8 mt-6 border-t border-border/60 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-stretch sm:items-center justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Looking for a similar setup for your business?</div><button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"button\" class=\"group/button inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center border bg-clip-padding whitespace-nowrap transition-all outline-none select-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-3 focus-visible:ring-ring/50 active:not-aria-[haspopup]:translate-y-px disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 aria-invalid:border-destructive aria-invalid:ring-3 aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:border-destructive/50 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 bg-background aria-expanded:bg-muted aria-expanded:text-foreground dark:border-input dark:bg-input/30 dark:hover:bg-input/50 h-7 px-2.5 text-[0.8rem] in-data-[slot=button-group]:rounded-lg has-data-[icon=inline-end]:pr-1.5 has-data-[icon=inline-start]:pl-1.5 [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-3.5 rounded-xl border-primary/30 hover:bg-primary hover:text-primary-foreground gap-2 font-medium\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap h-3.5 w-3.5 text-primary\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg><span>I Want a Solution Like This</span></button></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-16 md:py-20 bg-secondary/20 border-y border-border/50\"><div class=\"container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl text-center\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-primary/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide text-primary mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2 9.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 9.591-3.676.56.56 0 0 0 .818 0A5.49 5.49 0 0 1 22 9.5c0 2.29-1.5 4-3 5.5l-5.492 5.313a2 2 0 0 1-3 .019L5 15c-1.5-1.5-3-3.2-3-5.5\"></path></svg><span>NEIGHBOR-TO-NEIGHBOR INTEGRITY</span></div><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-medium tracking-tight text-foreground mb-6\">Why We Build for Local Groups &amp; Community Neighbors</h2><p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed mb-8\">When our neighbors thrive, the entire Georgetown Divide thrives. We build high-performance web systems for community clubs, local charities, and trade businesses alike because every local enterprise deserves a modern, lightning-fast digital storefront without corporate price tags, tech jargon, or monthly hostage fees.</p><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 text-left\"><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-zap h-6 w-6 text-primary mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 14a1 1 0 0 1-.78-1.63l9.9-10.2a.5.5 0 0 1 .86.46l-1.92 6.02A1 1 0 0 0 13 10h7a1 1 0 0 1 .78 1.63l-9.9 10.2a.5.5 0 0 1-.86-.46l1.92-6.02A1 1 0 0 0 11 14z\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-semibold mb-2\">Sierra Speed Certified</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">We test on spotty mountain cell connections. No massive 10MB images or clunky bloatware freezing up customers&#x27; screens.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone h-6 w-6 text-primary mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-semibold mb-2\">Direct Phone &amp; Orders</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Whether it&#x27;s a homeowner with an emergency roof leak or a hungry family looking for barbecue, we make contacting you effortless.</p></div><div class=\"p-6 rounded-2xl bg-card border border-border/60 shadow-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-6 w-6 text-primary mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-heading text-lg font-semibold mb-2\">You Own 100% of It</h3><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-muted-foreground leading-relaxed\">Zero proprietary platforms holding your business hostage. Transparent code, easy handoffs, and honest support.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 md:py-28 container mx-auto px-4 max-w-4xl text-center\"><div class=\"rounded-3xl bg-primary text-primary-foreground p-8 sm:p-12 md:p-16 shadow-2xl relative overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 -z-0 h-64 w-64 rounded-full bg-secondary/10 blur-3xl\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full bg-white/10 text-xs font-semibold text-secondary mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 6v6l4 2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle></svg> 15-Minute No-Pressure Chat</span><h2 class=\"font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl md:text-5xl font-medium tracking-tight mb-6\">Ready for a Website That Actually Rings Your Phone?</h2><p class=\"text-base sm:text-lg text-primary-foreground/80 max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed mb-10\">Whether you&#x27;re a contractor looking to lock in high-margin jobs, a local bakery needing a menu folks can actually read, or a service business ready to get found on Google—let&#x27;s build your 24/7 digital storefront.</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\"><button type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-slot=\"button\" class=\"